<title>GERMANY: Kohl to visit Australia, New Zealand in late April.</title>
<headline>Kohl to visit Australia, New Zealand in late April.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Chancellor Helmut Kohl is set to visit Australia and New Zealand at the end of April before travelling onto Hong Kong at the beginning of May, government sources said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
